{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midnight at Grimmi's is a\u00a0free fan project\u00a0focused on and dedicated to some of my favorite indie VTubers. The game\u00a0is a Reverse Bullet Hell or a Survivor-Like with a customizable hub. Mix and match your Character, Companion and Weapon for unique loadouts and synergies. Collect Relics and other Power-ups to defeat waves of enemies. You'll need all these tools an more in your quest to survive 7 nights in the evil witch's bog!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2068630?t=1766408677","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068630/bcda8f2f89f8b1a322957ecb51d1255956e30e1d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766408677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068630/61db303bbcc8ffbbdfd119024b702a946905e71b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766408677","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068630/61db303bbcc8ffbbdfd119024b702a946905e71b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766408677","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midnight at Grimmi's is a\u00a0free fan project\u00a0focused on and dedicated to some of my favorite indie VTubers. The game\u00a0is a Reverse Bullet Hell or a Survivor-Like with a customizable hub. Mix and match your Character, Companion and Weapon for unique loadouts and synergies. Collect Relics and other Power-ups to defeat waves of enemies. You'll need all these tools an more in your quest to survive 7 nights in the evil witch's bog!</p>","developers":["Cryomancerlex"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steam